            <h2>Mouseflow Privacy Policy</h2>
            <p>This website uses Mouseflow: a website analytics tool that provides valuable information about how users interact with and navigate through this website. The information is used to make the website faster and more user-friendly. Mouseflow provides session replay, heatmaps, funnels, form analytics, feedback surveys, journeys and similar features/functionality.</p>
            <p>Mouseflow may collect your clicks, mouse movements, scrolling, visited pages, time spent on the website, browser information and operating system, device type (desktop/tablet/phone), screen resolution, visitor type (first time/returning), referrer, anonymized IP address, location (city/country), responses to feedback surveys, preferred language, and similar metadata. The data collected using Mouseflow is not used to personally identify the visitor to this website. Mouseflow does not collect any information on pages where it is not installed, nor does it track or collect information outside your web browser.</p>
            <p>For more information about Mouseflow and its services, please visit: <a href="https://www.mouseflow.com">https://www.mouseflow.com</a>.</p>
            <p>Mouseflow’s Privacy Policy can be found at: <a href="https://mouseflow.com/legal/company/privacy-policy/">https://mouseflow.com/legal/company/privacy-policy/</a>.</p>
            <p>The legal basis for activating Mouseflow cookies is your consent (Art. 6 Para. 1 (a) GDPR). You can deactivate these cookies at any time by updating your cookie settings. Alternatively, you can opt-out here: <a href="https://mouseflow.com/opt-out">https://mouseflow.com/opt-out</a>.</p>

